cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Raven One SimuLink
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  An educational C# WinForms desktop application that simulates the RSA
  public-key cryptosystem and the MD5 message-digest algorithm, tracing
  every RSA intermediate step by step and computing MD5 digests with a
  from-scratch 64-round engine. Developed as the practical component of
  the Bachelor thesis "Password-/Keyless authentication" at TH Köln
  (University of Applied Sciences).
